   "issue": "`readsFrom_refl` closes `C.coord i s y = (1 : F \u2192L[\u211d] F) (C.coord i s (id y))` with a bare `rfl`. It works only because `1` happens to be defined as `.id`, the coercion unfolds, and `id y` reduces to `y`. That is accidental definitional equality across a coercion, with no comment.",
